# The unit of work variation point attaches to the PostgreSQL example: it adds
# the unit of work over the database (a GORM plugin in
# internal/infrastructure/postgres/unitofwork), the command middleware that ends
# it, and the sample command ImportItems with its scenarios, and changes only
# these files: the composition root, which attaches the unit and lists the
# middleware, the command registry, which builds ImportItems over the decorated
# AddItem, and the readme.
base library/architecture/go/vp-postgres-in-go.skill/examples
change cmd/todo/main.go
change internal/command/handlers.go
change README.md
change internal/command/test/runner_test.go
